    "gemini",
    "kiro"
  ],
  "summary": "Agent for cilium-external-connectivity-review. Decide whether traffic crossing the cluster boundary through BGP Control Plane advertisement, LB-IPAM, L2 announcements, the egress gateway or ClusterMesh is reachable, correctly owned, bounded and failure-isolated as claimed. Separates control-plane state from datapath reachability and checks documented incompatibilities and failure behavior. Static review: never changes BGP, pools, announcements, gateways or mesh configuration.",
  "source_type": "original",
  "official_docs": [
    "https://docs.cilium.io/en/stable/network/bgp-control-plane/bgp-control-plane/",
    "https://docs.cilium.io/en/stable/network/lb-ipam/",
    "https://docs.cilium.io/en/stable/network/l2-announcements/",
    "https://docs.cilium.io/en/stable/network/egress-gateway/egress-gateway/",
    "https://docs.cilium.io/en/stable/network/clustermesh/"
  ],
  "security_notes": "Static review only. No live guard covers BGP, LB-IPAM or L2 announcement resources, so every change there is a proposal for the human change process. A ClusterMesh is one trust domain; never request BGP auth Secrets, mesh certificates or kvstore credentials.",
  "last_verified": "2026-11-25",
